# 0xraiven

Specialized GitHub profile repository powering the public telemetry, research index, and dynamic status streaming for **0xraiven / r41n**.

## Overview

Cybersecurity researcher & systems engineer exploring offensive primitives, Linux host telemetry, and explainable detection pipelines. Dissecting attack surfaces down to daemon and initialization vectors to engineer inspectable, high-resilience security systems.

## Primary Research & Tooling

- **phishGuard**: Privacy-first ML phishing detection platform & Chrome MV3 extension. Multi-layered defense-in-depth pipeline decoupling URL canonicalization, structural heuristics, and CatBoost inference with SHAP explainability.
- **persistHunt**: Linux persistence detection framework standardizing host anomaly telemetry across cron schedules, systemd service units, and shell environment initialization vectors.
- **NightQuill**: Secure notes and collaborative knowledge repository architecture with end-to-end cryptographic boundaries.

## Operational Philosophy

Emphasizes rigorous attack surface reduction, transparent detection rules, reproducible test harnesses, and strict host audit integrity.
